00:23:53,380 --> 00:23:57,900
Guardian modules for pausing non-critical functions under defined conditions.

222
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Beyond Medical Research. You can prove this model works with a twenty-seven point two billion dollar treasury.

